### Subscribers Service API Tests

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8082/health

### List Subscribers (page 1)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/subscribers?page=1&limit=20

### Search Subscribers
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/subscribers/search?q=Иванов

### Get Subscriber by ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/subscribers/1

### Get Subscriber by Account Number
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/subscribers/account/12345

### Create Subscriber
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_number": "12345",
  "last_name": "Иванов",
  "first_name": "Иван",
  "middle_name": "Иванович",
  "email": "ivanov@example.com",
  "phone": "+7 (999) 123-45-67",
  "address": "г. Москва, ул. Ленина, д. 1, кв. 1"
}

### Update Subscriber
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/subscribers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+7 (999) 999-99-99"
}

### Delete Subscriber
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/v1/subscribers/1
